{
  "_note": "work is in work points. auto: the recipe of an automatic machine (research assembler): its work runs by itself at one point per second times the machine speed while it has power. water_net: units of network water a batch takes when it starts. One work point = one second of work by a healthy, qualified colonist. 'cook' is the kitchen menu: the dish, its ingredients and its work come from dishes.json (see sim/production.gd). A machine with several recipes lists them in buildings.json 'recipes'; the player picks one with set_recipe. stock_max: the machine stops while the colony holds this many units of its output (it would only fill the stores).",
